  "body": "> com.digitalasset.canton.admin.time.v30 的包级别概述。\n\n<p class=\"x2mdx-ref-back\"><a href=\"../index\">返回概览</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-hero\">\n  <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-eyebrow\">Protobuf 包</p>\n\n  <h1 class=\"x2mdx-ref-title\">com.digitalasset.canton.admin.time.v30</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-summary\">0 个服务、0 个端点、2 条消息</p>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n    <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">gRPC</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>文件</dt>\n      <dd>1</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>服务</dt>\n      <dd>0</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>端点</dt>\n      <dd>0</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>消息</dt>\n      <dd>2</dd>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n      <dt>枚举</dt>\n      <dd>0</dd>\n    </div>\n  </dl>\n</div>\n\n## 源文件\n\n<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-grid\">\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card x2mdx-ref-card--static\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-head\">\n      <h3>community/admin-api/src/main/protobuf/com/digitalasset/canton/admin/time/v30/time\\_tracker\\_config.proto</h3>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-card-summary\">最新发布的描述符快照中的当前源文件。</p>\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>服务</dt>\n        <dd>0</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>消息</dt>\n        <dd>2</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>枚举</dt>\n        <dd>0</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>来源</dt>\n        <dd><a href=\"https://github.com/DACH-NY/canton/blob/v3.5.1/community/admin-api/src/main/protobuf/com/digitalasset/canton/admin/time/v30/time_ tracker_config.proto\">community/admin-api/src/main/protobuf/com/digitalasset/canton/admin/time/v30/time\\_tracker\\_config.proto</a></dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n## 类型库存\n\n这些是发布版本快照中的包级消息和枚举形状。\n\n<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-schema\" id=\"schema-com-digitalasset-canton-admin-time-v30-同步器timetrackerconfig\">\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-schema-head\">\n    <h3>com.digitalasset.canton.admin.time.v30.同步器TimeTrackerConfig</h3>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-schema-summary\">4 个字段</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-fields\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n        <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">观察\\_延迟</code>\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">持续时间</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n        <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">耐心\\_duration</code>\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">持续时间</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n        <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">min\\_observation\\_duration</code>\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">持续时间</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n        <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">时间\\_proof\\_request</code>\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">TimeProofRequestConfig</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-schema\" id=\"schema-com-digitalasset-canton-admin-time-v30-timeproofrequestconfig\">\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-schema-head\">\n    <h3>com.digitalasset.canton.admin.time.v30.TimeProofRequestConfig</h3>\n\n    <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-schema-summary\">3 个字段</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-fields\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n        <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">初始\\_重试\\_延迟</code>\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">持续时间</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n        <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">max\\_retry\\_delay</code>\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">持续时间</span>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n        <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">最大\\_排序\\_延迟</code>\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">持续时间</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
